  - method: Gaussian radial ring and Lyra & Lin vortex (Gaussian in r and theta) Fourier transformed and sampled at observed uv-positions; chi^2 minimized; PA fixed from CO moment 1; center and inclination free [Analysis: "Each model realization is Fourier transformed and sampled at the same *uv*-positions as the observation."]
  - software: emcee
